# AboveBound local-first static web app.
# All optimization and self-build exploration runs on the user's device.
# No backend config, AWS keys, Supabase service role or tunnel secrets.
#
# Optional: Cloud memory is configured by the user in the app using their
# Supabase Project URL and PUBLIC PUBLISHABLE key. Auth + RLS required.
# The schema is in supabase/migrations/20261011000000_ab_computation_memory.sql.
#
# Local: npm ci && npm run dev
# Static: npm run build -> dist/ ; serve over HTTPS for Worker and storage.
